Leonard F. Konikow and John D. Bredehoeft, 2020. The Groundwater Project. ISBN 978-1-7770541-4-4, 96 pages. [Read online](https://books.gw-project.org/groundwater-resource-development/) · [Publisher and download](https://gw-project.org/books/groundwater-resource-development/) · [Copyright](https://books.gw-project.org/groundwater-resource-development/front-matter/copyright/).

Read the complete book, including its case studies and exercises. Begin with chapters 1–3; return to storage depletion in chapter 4, capture in chapter 5, and the two cases in chapter 6. Work the chapter 8 exercises before consulting their solutions. These readings extend the aquifer physics introduced in the shared geology Records into the consequences of supply development.

